<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-8">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using Munchy Cow ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these
        Terms of Service. If you don't agree, please don't use the Service.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        Munchy Cow provides audio processing services that clean up and enhance audio
        recordings. You upload audio files, we process them, and you download the results.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Your Account</h2>
      <p>
        You're responsible for maintaining the security of your account and password.
        We can't and won't be liable for any loss or damage from your failure to
        comply with this security obligation.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Your Content</h2>
      <p>
        You retain all rights to the audio you upload. By uploading content, you grant
        us a limited license to process it as needed to provide the Service. We don't
        claim ownership of your content and won't use it for any purpose other than
        providing the Service to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        You're responsible for ensuring you have the right to upload and process any
        audio you submit. Don't upload content you don't have rights to.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
        <li>Upload malicious files or attempt to harm our systems</li>
        <li>Attempt to access other users' accounts or data</li>
        <li>Resell or redistribute the Service without permission</li>
        <li>Use automated systems to abuse the Service</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Payment and Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Paid plans are billed monthly or annually as selected. You can cancel at any
        time, and your access continues until the end of your billing period.
        We generally don't offer refunds, but if something goes wrong, reach out
        and we'll make it right.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Service Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We strive to keep the Service available, but we can't guarantee 100% uptime.
        Sometimes things break. We'll do our best to fix issues quickly.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We're not
        liable for any damages arising from your use of the Service, including but
        not limited to loss of data or profits.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. We'll notify you of significant
        changes via email or through the Service. Continued use after changes means
        you accept the new terms.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may terminate or suspend your account if you violate these terms. You can
        also delete your account at any time through the settings page.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Contact us at support@munchycow.com.
      </p>
